<title>UK: SOCCER-HEDMAN SET FOR COVENTRY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-HEDMAN SET FOR COVENTRY.</headline>
<dateline>COVENTRY, England 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish international goalkeeper Magnus Hedman is expected to sign for Coventry City on Tuesday after agreeing personal terms with the English premier league club on Monday.</p>
<p>Coventry, who only just escaped relegation last season, are set to pay Hedman's current club, AIK Stockholm, 500,000 pounds ($840,000).</p>
